.TH IPTV-TUI 1 "2026" "iptv-tui" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
iptv-tui \- terminal UI to browse free IPTV playlists and play channels
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B iptv-tui
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B iptv-tui
is a terminal user interface for browsing free IPTV playlists from
iptv-org and Free-TV, grouped by country or category, with live per-stream
reachability probing so dead or geo-blocked channels are visible before you
open them. Channels can be played in an external window or inline in the
terminal (via mpv), and favorites and recently played channels are remembered.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-refresh
Force a re-download of playlists, ignoring the cache.
.TP
.B \-player \fImpv|vlc|ffplay\fR
Preferred external player (default: auto-detect, mpv first).
.TP
.B \-theme \fINAME\fR
Color theme; use \fB\-themes\fR to list. Default \fBauto\fR follows the
terminal's light/dark background.
.TP
.B \-themes
List available themes and exit.
.TP
.B \-api
Ingest the built-in iptv-org source from its JSON API (stable IDs, categories)
instead of M3U. Affects only that built-in source; user and Free-TV lists are
unchanged.
.TP
.B \-probe-concurrency \fIN\fR
Maximum concurrent reachability probes (default 12).
.TP
.B \-probe-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
Per-probe timeout (default 6s).
.TP
.B \-probe-all
Probe every channel in the background at startup.
.TP
.B \-cache \fIDIR\fR
Override the playlist cache directory.
.TP
.B \-export \fIDIR\fR
Rebuild all.m3u and per-country playlists from upstream into DIR, then exit.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B enter
Open a group, or play the selected channel in a window.
.TP
.B t
Play the selected channel inline in the terminal (requires mpv).
.TP
.B f
Toggle favorite.
.TP
.B g
Switch grouping between country and category.
.TP
.B s
Open the sources manager (add/remove your own playlists).
.TP
.B /
Filter the current list.
.TP
.B r
Re-probe the current group.
.TP
.B R
Reload playlists from source.
.TP
.B p
Cycle the external player.
.TP
.B ?
Toggle the help overlay.
.TP
.B q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/iptv/config.json
Optional user configuration: theme, player, api, and extra sources.
.TP
.I ./iptv.local.json
Optional repo-local configuration (gitignored).
.TP
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/iptv/
Cached playlists and persisted favorites/last-played (state.json).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpv (1),
.BR vlc (1),
.BR ffplay (1)
